WEBVTT

00:03:28.615 --> 00:03:30.855
Molekuli sio tu molekuli.

00:03:30.879 --> 00:03:33.633
Inaweza kumaanisha vitu tofauti
kulingana na muktadha,

00:03:34.404 --> 00:03:37.346
kama tu vilio vya watoto
vinavyomaanisha vitu tofauti:

00:03:37.370 --> 00:03:39.140
saa nyingine mtoto ana njaa,

00:03:39.164 --> 00:03:40.358
saa nyingine amelowa,

00:03:40.382 --> 00:03:42.401
saa nyingine ameumia au anaogopa.

00:03:42.425 --> 00:03:44.775
Wazazi wanajua jinsi ya kusoma hivi vilio.

00:03:45.624 --> 00:03:47.506
Na kua chombo kizuri cha kutafsiri,

00:03:47.530 --> 00:03:50.503
kinatakiwa kiwe na uwezo wa kusoma
molekuli za ishara

00:03:50.527 --> 00:03:54.588
na kuzitafsiri
kulingana na muktadha.

00:03:55.497 --> 00:03:56.648
Na nani anajua?

00:03:56.672 --> 00:03:58.833
Labda Tafsiri ya Google inaweza
kuiptisha hii.

00:03:58.857 --> 00:04:01.226
(Kicheko)